  "objective_summary": "Landed SemanticReconciliation@1 as the merge-package surface that gates merge admission and refreshes canonical semantic state only after queue acceptance. Before merge the gate verifies predicted effects, contracts, selected tests/proofs (including verified empty), governor disposition, assurance evidence, and seal identity against the candidate tree. After queue acceptance the surface rescans the accepted canonical tree, compares predicted and observed deltas, invalidates dependents, updates the semantic snapshot, reevaluates goals, and revises until settled. MergeQueue gains require_pre_merge_semantic_gate, complete_with_semantic_reconciliation, and fail-closed completion when the gate is required. This surface never publishes datasets canonical roots, never authorizes worker completion as acceptance, and never treats task status alone as success.",
